# Manifold level 10
# The tower's entrance (stage 5d): the first beat, shown, on the ground, where a fall costs nothing.
# A hop onto a platform; a wall 3 m high whose ledge is grabbed (the gym: up to 3.25 m); and the
# wall jump: a chimney 2.4 m wide (up to 4 m climbs) up to the terrace 6 m up, the goal. Stars: on
# a pillar 3 m high (its ledge), on an island a running jump away (4 m: walking, 3.4; running, 5.6),
# and at the top of a chimney 3.2 m wide and 9 m high.
title The entrance
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
sky 18.6

